{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415486","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415486","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1041548601:1":{"text":"よう、そこの狼の兄ちゃん。俺と勝負しないか？","source_cn":"嗬！一位狼兄弟！要不要和我来一场决斗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9551EFC0A0CA2E65","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041548602:1":{"text":"勝負？\n……私は、君に何か恨まれるような事でもしたかな？","source_cn":"决斗？\\n……我们之间有什么仇怨吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x49D1DCB576512DBB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041548603:1":{"text":"勝負は勝負だろ！恨みなんて関係あるか？","source_cn":"决斗就是决斗！和仇怨有什么关系？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAAFD748D156A5CCC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041548604:1":{"text":"……すまないが、断る。一人酒を楽しみ、思いにふけるプライベートな空間に、暴力を持ち込みたくないのでね。","source_cn":"……恕我拒绝。这是个独酌和沉思的私密空间，不是个动手的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D8E62BEB779DBFE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041548605:1":{"text":"なら外で勝負しろ！","source_cn":"那我们到外面去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A957B78AE31CB1E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041548606:1":{"text":"……君と戦う気はない。","source_cn":"……我无心与你争斗。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF5FE2C5068B2672","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041548607:1":{"text":"あん？ババリアのくせに、俺と戦いたくないのか？勝利の栄光を手にしたくないのか！","source_cn":"嗯？作为蛮血的一员，你难道不想与我一战？胜利本身就是最...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x610BC01C13AAAC30","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041548608:1":{"text":"お前が勝てば、俺の尊敬を得られるんだぞ！","source_cn":"要是你赢了，你还能赢得我的尊重！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD86B2D59CB215B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041548609:1":{"text":"誤解だ。私はババリアではなく、ヴェルディア連盟の者だ。","source_cn":"你误会了，我来自绿裔联盟，而非蛮血部落。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4987A7F4CB7625C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041548610:1":{"text":"お前、ヴェルディアに入ったのか！？","source_cn":"你竟然加入了绿裔？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C3340F23DB5CC57","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041548611:1":{"text":"ああ。君と私は理念が違う。私は武力を崇拝していない。よければ座って一緒にお茶でもどうだ？","source_cn":"没错。你我观念不同，我并不崇尚武力。坐下来喝一杯茶水吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F2B755A14CE8890","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041548612:1":{"text":"ヴェルディアでも関係ない！どんな身分であろうと、勝負で勝ち取った栄光は同じだ！","source_cn":"绿裔联盟也没关系！决斗获胜赢得的荣誉，不会因为你的身份...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBCFD1CE26F75FF4B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041548613:1":{"text":"……やれやれ、今日は静かに飲めそうにないな。","source_cn":"……唉，看来今天没法获得宁静了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB12ABAC574A78A1B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:沙奎尔":{"text":"シャキール","source":"沙奎尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:法拉莫尔":{"text":"フェルガルド","source":"法拉莫尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":14,"localized_text_count":13,"speaker_count":2}}